====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[consider]] carefully; to weigh well in the mind.
#: {{ux|en|It is now time for the jury to '''deliberate''' the guilt of the defendant.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[consider]] the reasons for and against anything; to [[reflect]].

